  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d9366127076758c4d9758f83d75a66b2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _textContent:
  - _loc: 0
    _content: "Le journaliste Carl Morel remporte un nouveau prix de journalisme
      gr\xE2ce \xE0 son dernier reportage sur la Mafia am\xE9ricaine. Ce jeune auteur
      brille sur la sc\xE8ne t\xE9l\xE9vis\xE9e depuis maintenant quelque temps,
      et ne semble pas vouloir arr\xEAter son assencion. Le monde du journalisme
      accueille une nouvelle g\xE9n\xE9ration qui semble savoir quelle direction
      prendre.\nBonne chance \xE0 Mr.Morel, et qu\u2019il continue \xE0 faire briller
      le journalisme moderne."
  - _loc: 1
    _content: 'Journalist Carl Morel has won another journalism award for his latest
      report on the American Mafia. This young writer has been shining on the television
      scene for some time now and shows no signs of slowing down his ascent. The
      world of journalism is welcoming a new generation that seems to know exactly
      which direction to take.

      Good luck to Mr. Morel, and may he continue
      to make modern journalism shine.'
  _textOverride: {fileID: 0}
